      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Behavior\n\n## Implemented behavior\n\nFieldNode listens for nodeInput addressed to its set input, updates data.value through nodeUpdate, and emits nodeOutput for value. editorResolutionPolicy distinguishes product-owned editors from class-backed editing.\n\n## Known gaps\n\nThe mounted UI/event path is not proved by schema inspection. The library’s structural test checks this spec; focused editor tests cover only their stated policy. Do not infer fieldType imposes universal runtime type validation.\n\n## Open decisions\n\nNo additional decision is required to describe the behavior above. Changes to that contract require an explicit task; implementation gaps are not implied approvals.\n\n## Evidence\n\nSource (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/Nodes/FieldNode.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/editorResolutionPolicy.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/editorFieldTypes.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/editorResolutionPolicy.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-field",
          "nodeId": "field-behavior"
        }
      }
    },
